Welcome to Clue.
Someone was murdered in this mansion. Find out who did it, where, and with what.
Type 'help' for the list of commands.
== ballroom ==
A chandelier lights a floor polished for dancing nobody came to do.
  north  study
  south  nothing
  east   nothing
  west   lounge
Characters here: none
Items here: candlestick
> Commands:
  help             show this table of commands
  list             list every room, character and item
  look             describe the room you are in
  go DIRECTION     walk north, south, east or west
  take ITEM        pick up an item lying in the room
  drop ITEM        put down an item you are carrying
  inventory        show what you are carrying
  clue CHARACTER   summon a character and test your theory
  quit             leave the game
> Goodbye.
